      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for catching the problem, Charan.\n\nI am curious whether this is general problem or not between page_ext and offline.\n\nCPU A is accessing random page descriptor(so access page_ext naturally since page_ext is extension of struct page) but CPU B is offlining and then free the page_ext?\n\nA example,\n\npage_idle_bitmap_read                      \n  page_is_idle                          free_ext\n     lookup_page_ext\n",
